{"parse": {"title": "苦目软糖", "pageid": 28073, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"item-infobox\"><div style=\"position:absolute; width:100%; height:100%; overflow:hidden;\"><div class=\"glow-top\"><div></div></div><div class=\"glow-bottom\"><div></div></div></div><div class=\"item-infobox-box\"><div class=\"item-infobox-image\"><img alt=\"苦目软糖\" src=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/c/cc/Item-30.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"苦目软糖\" width=\"256\" height=\"256\" class=\"img-fit mid-position\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></div><div class=\"item-infobox-content\"><div class=\"serif\" style=\"font-size:22px\"><b>苦目软糖</b><img alt=\"CurrencyIcon-30 1.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/CurrencyIcon-30_1.png/24px-CurrencyIcon-30_1.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/CurrencyIcon-30_1.png/36px-CurrencyIcon-30_1.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7b/CurrencyIcon-30_1.png/48px-CurrencyIcon-30_1.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"54\" data-file-height=\"54\" /><div class=\"hide-m test-hide grey-small\" style=\"float:right; font-family:sans-serif; font-size:16px\"><span class=\"no-select\">编号ID：</span>3#30</div></div><hr /><div>“多彩熊生”牌软糖，零食货架上最先售空的小家伙。可恢复微量细胞活性。</div><div style=\"color:#696969\">某次意外使得研究员们寻得了这种便捷的方法，得以更迅速地削减苦目树刺激性的味道。是的，这就是商店常常断货的软糖。它们外形可爱，在萃取液中经过长久浸泡。注意：请从头部开始食用。</div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "物品"}], "displaytitle": "苦目软糖"}}